# 🏦 Plataforma Bancaria Blockchain

> Ecosistema financiero completo que combina un banco digital, blockchain privado permisionado, exchange de criptomonedas y sistema de inversiones con trazabilidad inmutable.

[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)
[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-5.0-blue)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)
[![Rust](https://img.shields.io/badge/Rust-1.75-orange)](https://www.rust-lang.org/)
[![Go](https://img.shields.io/badge/Go-1.21-cyan)](https://golang.org/)

